      "text": "A Berry to be consumed by Pokémon. If a Pokémon\nholds one, one of its stats will sharply increase\nwhen it’s in a pinch.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンに　持たせると\nピンチのとき　どれか　１つの\n能力が　ぐーんと　あがる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "让宝可梦携带后，危机时，\n某一项能力就会大幅提高。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Si la lleva un Pokémon, aumenta mucho una\ncaracterística en un momento de apuro.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
